# Atlas session loop (Halo chats)

Cursor chats are invisible to Atlas managers and the phone agent until dumped.

- Start: if Atlas is up, `GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/agent/where_we_left_off` (Bearer `ATLAS_AGENT_TOKEN` from `atlas/server/.env`).
- Wrap-up / "sync for phone" / shipping Halo work: `POST /agent/session_close` with a 3–8 bullet note and `"workspacePath"` set to this repo, or `cd atlas/server && npm run refresh-phone-knowledge -- --note "..."`.
- Do not claim the phone agent is current until that dump succeeds.
